node_modules

# Render output is ignored, with one exception: the finished film itself is the
# deliverable, so dtt-bhutan-build-story-web.mp4 is committed. The CRF 17 master
# beside it is not — it is 55MB to the web encode's 19MB and, on a film of
# static UI and slow pans, indistinguishable.
out/*
!out/dtt-bhutan-build-story-web.mp4
